bb_paragraph\" >Watering with Watercan: Essential for nurturing crops in farming games. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead: Static dead sprite for impactful in-game consequences. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity and streamline your game development process with Pixelart Character Creator. Craft characters that resonate with your vision and captivate your audience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089670/extras/942d3479b0ff6cf6585b1a1a0d427187.poster.avif?t=1737458485\" width=800 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089670/extras/942d3479b0ff6cf6585b1a1a0d427187.webm?t=1737458485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089670/extras/942d3479b0ff6cf6585b1a1a0d427187.mp4?t=1737458485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089670/extras/1e52f705f17f60d0c26b7696fab4dc93.poster.avif?t=1737458485\" width=800 height=46 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089670/extras/1e52f705f17f60d0c26b7696fab4dc93.webm?t=1737458485\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3089670/extras/1e52f705f17f60d0c26b7696fab4dc93.mp4?t=1737458485\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
